cies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stranded-root-members: add an agent_name candidate-filter field to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-core artifact index and query agent_session OR agent_name from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stranded collector, so a session's root member (agent_session null) is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]no longer reported unknown/no_records.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Raise one wait alert per stranded bead a live waiter is [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]blocked on[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]stranded-bead-wait-alert[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stranded-root-members[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stranded-bead-wait-alert: make wait_checks classify the unclosed beads [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that live waiters block on through a targeted, TTL-cached stranded-work [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collection, and upsert one deduplicated, self-dismissing notification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per stranded bead with its cause and relaunch command.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Warn or refuse when an agent targets a one-segment near-miss [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]of its assigned bead[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]assigned-bead-near-miss[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]assigned-bead-near-miss: detect, inside SASE agents, bead IDs that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]differ from the assigned bead by one inserted or deleted non-trailing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]segment; banner the read output, refuse close/open per the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]near_miss_mutation decision, and tighten the phase and task work [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop plan propose from parenting new epics under an [/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]already-closed bead[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]closed-parent-stamp[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed-parent-stamp: skip the automatic parent_bead stamp in sase plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propose when the proposing agent's active bead is already closed, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]follow-on campaign epics are top-level instead of growing the ID one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]segment per batch.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1ok","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1ok.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-65089ee3296162a26801c3e54018705c","started_at":"2026-10-26T22:16:37.461121+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f6975bafb0baa4a88da25a2789413dd2d3c4a9af90d3f4d87b389839173154c4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"14d1c18734ea41dd4906fe50df6f1602d0b4468ca4cfea9cf29f17e5e102adc9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/meta.json","size_bytes":659},"prompt":{"digest":"9f6758322b90ab95b72946bf1ae5212430fd1c46bdbc7539250c35d2a47472d6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":163},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"366a575864f9250d0ed8225172efafee8a53307fb1594e69f3b8ee546d16f44d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4204},"state":{"digest":"a110ab6598c39c4e8cd9e40203e54c01a67512c799c7a00ca0776d69a653df19","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ok.2/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name